    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Um… my head was a mess just now. Thanks for telling me about what was happening on the plane.",
        "zh": "那个......刚才我脑子有点乱，谢谢你告诉我飞机上的事。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Same here. Thank you for getting me out of there.",
        "zh": "我也是，谢谢你带我离开那里。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yeah, but I can’t just abandon the people on that plane. Let’s part ways here.",
        "zh": "嗯，但我不能放着飞机上的人不管，我们就在这里分别吧。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
